field-limit</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_T\\varnothing\\prime\">\\(A\\le_T\\varnothing\\prime\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Low}_2(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Low}_2(A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"47dda3af2234de34\" href=\"?note=47dda3af2234de34\" title=\"20-thm-low2-uniform-functions\">20-thm-low2-uniform-functions</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d81dfad676f32c4a\" href=\"?note=d81dfad676f32c4a\" title=\"20-thm-shoenfield-limit\">20-thm-shoenfield-limit</a>。</p>\n<p>以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 的全可计算性表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathcal C_3\">\\(a\\in\\mathcal C_3\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(a)=\\omega^3\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(a)=\\omega^3\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}low2-matrix-approximation}\\vdash\n\\exists a\\in\\mathcal C_3\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{dom}(a)=\\omega^3\\land\\operatorname{ran}(a)\\subseteq2\\land\n\\forall x,e\\ \\exists b&lt;2\\ \\exists t\\ \\forall s\\ge t\\ [a(x,e,s)=b],\\\\\n\\{Y:Y\\le_T A\\}=\\{\\{x:\\lim_s a(x,e,s)=1\\}:e\\in\\omega\\}\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}low2-matrix-approximation}\\vdash\n\\exists a\\in\\mathcal C_3\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{dom}(a)=\\omega^3\\land\\operatorname{ran}(a)\\subseteq2\\land\n\\forall x,e\\ \\exists b&lt;2\\ \\exists t\\ \\forall s\\ge t\\ [a(x,e,s)=b],\\\\\n\\{Y:Y\\le_T A\\}=\\{\\{x:\\lim_s a(x,e,s)=1\\}:e\\in\\omega\\}\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\prime\">\\(0\\prime\\)</span> 可计算的二值统一矩阵按配对编码成一元函数，再对该函数应用极限引理。输出逐项截成二值不会改变已稳定的 0 或 1。统一性在三个参数上保留，不能仅为每一行各取一个无统一性的近似。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollary 4.9.3；印刷页 102；PDF 第 138 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-low2-uniform-functions","status":"resolved","id":"47dda3af2234de34","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-low2-uniform-functions]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-shoenfield-limit","status":"resolved","id":"d81dfad676f32c4a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-shoenfield-limit]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-low2-uniform-functions","status":"resolved","id":"47dda3af2234de34","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-low2-uniform-functions]]；see [[20-thm-shoenfield-limit]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-shoenfield-limit","status":"resolved","id":"d81dfad676f32c4a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-low2-uniform-functions]]；see [[20-thm-shoenfield-limit]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\le_T\\varnothing\\prime","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Low}_2(A)","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathcal C_3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(a)=\\omega^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}low2-matrix-approximation}\\vdash\n\\exists a\\in\\mathcal C_3\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{dom}(a)=\\omega^3\\land\\operatorname{ran}(a)\\subseteq2\\land\n\\forall x,e\\ \\exists b<2\\ \\exists t\\ \\forall s\\ge t\\ [a(x,e,s)=b],\\\\\n\\{Y:Y\\le_T A\\}=\\{\\{x:\\lim_s a(x,e,s)=1\\}:e\\in\\omega\\}\n\\end{gathered}\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"0\\prime","display":false}],"bytes":1588,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["47dda3af2234de34","d81dfad676f32c4a"]}